# Upgrade rehearsal overlay for the Twin chain (918453), issue 1811 (upgradeability stage 4).
# The committed Twin sheet (stage-sheet.env) stays UPGRADE_MODE=frozen. The upgrade rehearsal job (suite-28 core-stages-twin-upgrade-lifecycle)
# merges these lines over it, so the same release artifacts deploy upgradeable, then the rehearsal upgrades the gateway through the real Safe and
# timelock, freezes every core proxy the same way, and shows a queued upgrade is refused after the freeze (publish-contracts/src/ci/twin-upgrade-lifecycle.ts).
# Later lines win in merge-sheet. No secret belongs in this file.
UPGRADE_MODE=upgradeable
# No UPGRADE_FREEZE_DEADLINE here (issue 1846): twin-publish derives it from the pin block timestamp plus 365 days, so the Twin clock never reaches it.
